<article class="env-corollary" id="064Y">
<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/064Y">Corollary <span data-tag="064Y">9.2.5.26</span>.</a> Let $\operatorname{\mathcal{C}}$ be an $\infty $-category which admits small filtered colimits. Then the collection of compact objects of $\operatorname{\mathcal{C}}$ is closed under finite colimits. </p>
